1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,260
(Leonard:)Forget the robot. What happened to you?

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,510
- He slipped and fell.
- Yes.

3
00:00:06,677 --> 00:00:08,257
(Howard:)I slipped and fell.

4
00:00:08,429 --> 00:00:09,759
(Howard:)In the bathroom.

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,850
(Howard:)Bounced right off the tub.

6
00:00:13,017 --> 00:00:15,307
(Penny:)Yes. Now he knows
what bathtubs are capable of doing...

7
00:00:15,477 --> 00:00:17,437
(Penny:)...when you don't treat them
with respect.

8
00:00:17,938 --> 00:00:19,398
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

9
00:00:19,648 --> 00:00:22,608
They sucker-punch you
when your eyes are closed.

10
00:00:24,278 --> 00:00:26,108
(Sheldon:)So, what do you think, Howard?

11
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,320
It... It's not that bad, right?

12
00:00:28,866 --> 00:00:31,906
Yeah, no.
A little electrical tape, some solder...

13
00:00:32,077 --> 00:00:33,617
(Howard:)Are you insane?

14
00:00:33,787 --> 00:00:38,337
(Howard:)I've seen space probes that crashed into the
desert that were in better shape than this.

15
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,040
(Sheldon:)You're right.

16
00:00:41,212 --> 00:00:42,632
(Sheldon:)Monte's gone.

17
00:00:42,796 --> 00:00:46,136
(Sheldon:)We'll bury him in the morning.
A simple ceremony. I'll speak.

18
00:00:46,717 --> 00:00:48,967
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you'll play your cello.

19
00:00:49,845 --> 00:00:54,095
(Penny:)Sheldon, honey, aren't you getting a little
carried away? I mean, it's just a toy robot.

20
00:00:56,477 --> 00:00:58,357
(Sheldon:)Just a toy robot?

21
00:01:04,401 --> 00:01:05,611
(Penny:)Penny.

22
00:01:05,778 --> 00:01:06,988
(Penny:)I know, I got it.

23
00:01:07,988 --> 00:01:11,448
Sheldon? I'm sorry.

24
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:14,990
(Howard:)Well, don't get the wrong idea.

25
00:01:15,162 --> 00:01:18,542
(Howard:)The way I see it,
I'm halfway to pity sex.

